WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.468
Hey, oh, wow.
There you go, have a seat.

00:00:03.468 --> 00:00:06.201
Oy vey.
(laughs) Oy vey.

00:00:06.201 --> 00:00:08.869
Lawdy Miss Clawdy
How are you?

00:00:08.869 --> 00:00:10.548
Fine, how are you, sugar?
I'm very good.

00:00:10.548 --> 00:00:12.090
Thank you very much for coming on.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.204
Well you know, you're the cutest thing.

00:00:14.204 --> 00:00:17.751
(audience laughing)
Oh, thank you.

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:20.539
(audience applauding and cheering)

00:00:20.539 --> 00:00:22.085
You know, Conan, I've been watching you.

00:00:22.085 --> 00:00:25.122
You know, you can put your
shoes under my bed anytime.

00:00:25.122 --> 00:00:29.372
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:00:31.259 --> 00:00:35.473
(laughs) I'm not ready for
you, it's too late at night.

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:37.523
How are you?

00:00:37.523 --> 00:00:38.356
Thanks so much for coming on,
it's good to have you here.

00:00:38.356 --> 00:00:39.890
Well, thank you for asking me.

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.480
Yeah, you know, we were talking today,

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.150
the film looks hysterical, by the way.

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:45.719
The film looks very funny, and
everyone's talking about it.

00:00:45.719 --> 00:00:46.930
No kidding.
It was a big hit

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:48.570
over the weekend, this movie.
No kidding.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:51.823
Yeah, huge. (laughs)

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.756
That means I got another job.

00:00:54.756 --> 00:00:57.600
(laughs) That's right, but how are you?

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.200
You doing, I mean, we
were talking about today,

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.700
we were just looking at all your credits,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.510
all the stuff you've
been, so much theater,

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:03.880
but all these TV shows.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.530
So many people when they
see you recognize you

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.930
from all these classic TV
shows, '60s, '70s, '80s.

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:10.050
And you're still going.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:11.840
Well, you know, I just love show business.

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:13.020
Yeah?
I always wanted

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:15.140
to be in show business
so I'm in show business.

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:18.090
Of course I'm unemployed,
but I'm in show business.

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:20.900
What would you have done
if you weren't an actor?

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.930
What would you have done if
you had done something else?

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.466
What did you want to be?
I'd have been a stripper.

00:01:25.466 --> 00:01:30.466
(audience cheering,
applauding, and whistling)

00:01:30.863 --> 00:01:34.196
(sultry big band music)

00:01:42.508 --> 00:01:46.672
(Conan laughing and clapping)

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:49.760
Okay, I might marry you.
This guy's gonna marry you

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:51.347
now, yeah.
Well, that's cool

00:01:51.347 --> 00:01:52.580
(audience laughing)

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:54.530
That's cool.
Yeah.

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:56.200
Can I ask, this might be
an indelicate question,

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.570
but how old are you?

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:58.590
You look terrific.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:01.046
Old enough to know better
and young enough to try.

00:02:01.046 --> 00:02:02.850
(audience applauding and laughing)

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:03.683
[Conan] All right.

00:02:03.683 --> 00:02:05.130
What the, that got to do with it?

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:09.463
Hey!
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:29.990
So, how do you talk to your
grandchildren? (laughs)

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:32.660
What kind of bedtime
stories do you tell them?

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:33.493
Well, they'd say,

00:02:33.493 --> 00:02:36.157
"Grandma, will you tell
us a bedtime story?"

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:40.782
I said, "Why, yes."
(audience laughing)

00:02:40.782 --> 00:02:43.250
They said, "Will you tell us the one

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.755
about when you was a ho in Chicago?"

00:02:45.755 --> 00:02:50.755
(audience laughing,
applauding, and cheering)

00:02:52.514 --> 00:02:57.133
(laughs) Oh, oh man!

00:02:58.279 --> 00:03:03.279
(laughs) All right, oh my God.
(audience laughing)

00:03:04.683 --> 00:03:07.210
What else you wanna know?
I'm afraid to ask you

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:09.610
another question.
(audience laughing)

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:11.070
I've never been so scared in my life.

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:11.927
Let me ask you though,
I will ask you this.

00:03:11.927 --> 00:03:13.480
You know, the Wayans brothers,

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.040
you're in this movie with them.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:18.030
And in this movie you play
a pot smoking grandmother.

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:19.273
Yeah.
Now...

00:03:19.273 --> 00:03:20.970
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.930
Finally, an issue all
Americans can get behind, yeah.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:25.540
How did you feel about that
when they came to you and said,

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:27.450
you're gonna play a pot smoking granny?

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:28.915
I love the reefer!

00:03:28.915 --> 00:03:32.577
(crowd applauding, cheering, and laughing)

00:03:32.577 --> 00:03:36.077
(Conan and Andy laughing)

00:03:50.147 --> 00:03:52.501
Hey, some of y'all out
there like reefer, too,

00:03:52.501 --> 00:03:54.833
but you don't want
nobody to know it, right?

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:59.247
That's some good reefer, you got some?

00:03:59.247 --> 00:04:01.813
(audience laughing)

00:04:01.813 --> 00:04:03.540
It's in here, yeah.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.840
After the show.
Yeah, okay.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.314
That's what this mug is for, yeah.

00:04:06.314 --> 00:04:09.090
Oh.
(Conan and audience laughing)

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.570
People always wanna know,
what's with the Eisenhower mug?

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:14.330
Oh my God, the police are
gonna raid this interview

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:16.845
any moment now, take us all away.

00:04:16.845 --> 00:04:17.845
You're the cutest thing.

00:04:17.845 --> 00:04:20.193
I don't know what else to ask you.

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:21.956
Just, I'm afraid, I'm so afraid.

00:04:21.956 --> 00:04:26.956
No baby, don't be scared.
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:04:26.956 --> 00:04:28.646
I won't let nobody hurt you.

00:04:28.646 --> 00:04:29.479
You won't let nobody hurt me?

00:04:29.479 --> 00:04:30.312
All right.

00:04:30.312 --> 00:04:31.693
No, you're the sweeter little thing.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.019
Thank you, you just
stay with me, all right?

00:04:34.019 --> 00:04:35.371
Okay, okey doke.
I want you here, all right?

00:04:35.371 --> 00:04:36.431
Okey dokey.

00:04:36.431 --> 00:04:39.120
(laughs) You know, we are out of time.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.400
Can you come back 'cause
we gotta talk some more.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.610
This is...
Yeah.

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:43.447
Can you do that?
Let me see, let me see.

00:04:43.447 --> 00:04:47.453
Let me see, wait, wait,
hey, wait a minute.

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:51.020
I'm supposed to be in L.A. tomorrow.

00:04:52.307 --> 00:04:55.133
I'll have to ask my manager.
All right, well listen you--

00:04:55.133 --> 00:04:57.853
I has a manager, y'all.
(Conan laughing)

00:04:57.853 --> 00:05:02.103
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:05:03.649 --> 00:05:05.350
Will you come back?
Yes.

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:08.390
We gotta talk, we didn't get to anything.

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:10.689
It was just, come back soon,
would you please do that?

00:05:10.689 --> 00:05:11.522
Yeah.
Thank you.

00:05:11.522 --> 00:05:12.590
It was really nice to meet you.

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:14.902
Nice to meet you, too.
Come back next time.

00:05:14.902 --> 00:05:16.623
We'll shut the place down for you.

00:05:16.623 --> 00:05:17.456
Okay.
All right?

00:05:17.456 --> 00:05:20.357
Okay. (laughs)
Helen Martin, everybody!

00:05:20.357 --> 00:05:22.209
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:05:22.209 --> 00:05:24.960
The movie's "Don't Be a
Menace to South Central

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.540
While Drinking Your Juice in the Hood."

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.090
We'll be right back after this.

